      "extract": "Knot polynomials on braid closures Eddy Li January 29, 2025 Abstract We explore properties of the Jones and Alexander polynomials of braid closures of braids of index 3. We analyze how the evaluations of these polynomials at t = −1 force implications regarding the topological structure of the braid closure, such as its number of circles or the existence of splittings. As a consequence, we construct an infinite",
